>=20
>    /* An unaligned altar in Gehennom will always elicit rejection. */
>    if (ugod_is_angry() || (altaralign =3D=3D A_NONE && Inhell)) {
>                            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
>       ..bad things happen, or you get converted (not possible=20
>       with unaligned altar)..=20
>    }
>=20
> Consequently, you *could* convert aligned altars in Hell (CMIIW). =20
> However, currently there are no aligned altars in Hell, hence=20
> the effect is indistingushable from your interpretation. =20

